      "ja": "『魔神創造伝ワタル』より龍王丸が登場！",
      "en": "Ryuomaru appears from “Mashin Souzouden Wataru”!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 部位ごとにパーツを分けられるシリーズ共通フレームを採用。他の魔神と組み合わせて遊ぼう！",
      "en": "• Adopts a common frame across the series that allows parts to be separated by area. Let's play in combination with other genies!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• パチパチと手で外せるタッチゲート仕様。接着剤無しで組み立てられる！",
      "en": "• Touch gate design that can be removed by hand. Can be assembled without adhesive!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 両肩の龍王頭、青龍紋などはゴールドメタリックパーツで再現！",
      "en": "• The dragon head and blue dragon crest on both shoulders are reproduced with gold metallic parts!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 星龍剣はブルーのクリアパーツで再現！",
      "en": "• Star Dragon Sword is reproduced with blue clear parts!"
    }
